'''Vexing Retaliation''' is a [[Mission|PvE]] [[Warframe Augment Mod|Warframe Augment]] for {{WF|Chroma}} that makes {{A|Vex Armor}} detonate an area-of-effect attack upon receiving 150 incoming damage, dealing [[Status Effect|proc]]s on enemies.
<section end=intro />
