==Acquisition==
*This mod can be acquired by attaining the rank of '''Genius''' under {{Faction|Cephalon Suda}} or the rank of '''Partner''' under {{Faction|The Perrin Sequence}}, and spending {{sc|25,000}} to purchase.

==Notes==
*Vexing Retaliation will deal {{D|Puncture}} proc if receiving [[Shield]] damage, and {{D|Blast}} proc if receiving [[Health]] damage.
*The range of the damage procs is affected by [[Ability Range]]. 
**Requires Line of Sight to the target.
*The damage effect can trigger an unlimited number of times as long as Vex Armor is active.

